## Hide previous Explorer graph during loading

Context: The centered loading overlay used a translucent warm surface, so the
previous Sigma WebGL graph still showed through the spinner. Loading now
covers the canvas fully and hides all graph siblings until the overlay
clears.

Changes:

1. src/front/static/query/css/query-sigmagraph.css
   Use an opaque overlay surface and hide every `#sgContainer` sibling while
   `aria-busy` is true.
