Browser benchmark: three controlled depth-1 Lakehouse//RT expansions completed
in 5.30s, 15.13s, and 4.90s (5.30s median). Each used one expansion SQL
statement, returned 17 entities / 119 triples with HTTP 200, rendered the graph,
and produced no scoped browser or network errors. The 5.2s selection dwell
remained excluded from Total.

